          "name": "e1",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#ECEEE7",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 3,
          "padding": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PL1K9",
              "fill": "#2F3833",
              "content": "タイポグラフィ(手書きフォント)",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "4RW10",
              "fill": "#55605C",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "日本語すべて = こよみゆる(見出し・ボタンは太字+濃色) / 数字・英字 = Hetakawa Free(スコア・MISSION 表記。漢字非対応のため日本語には使わない)。スタイルは AppFont.swift の hand* に集約",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "cUeq4",
          "name": "e2",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#ECEEE7",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 3,
          "padding": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "or5UV",
              "fill": "#2F3833",
              "content": "インクカラー(可読性)",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PsKWu",
              "fill": "#55605C",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "キーカラー = ティール #2A7D6C(オレンジから変更)/ 背景 = グレイッシュグリーン #ECEEE7 / バッジ = #E9F4E6 + 緑文字 #3E8E41 / 本文インク #2F3833・補足 #55605C。キャラクター =「見ざる」猿(docs/Figma/mizaru2 1.png、ティール線画)。ミッション枠 = 手書きベクター(docs/Figma/Vector 22.png)",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "17kXu",
          "name": "e3",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#ECEEE7",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 3,
          "padding": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OEzYe",
              "fill": "#2F3833",
              "content": "人数ルールベース(内容と判定基準)",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "uGyh5",
              "fill": "#55605C",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1人 = セルフィー・観察系。人物条件なしでOK(自撮り笑顔/セルフ万歳) / 2人 =「ふたりで◯◯」。aiPrompt に 2人が写っている条件を必須 / 3〜5人 =「全員で◯◯」。N人以上が写り全員が条件を満たす。AR は1人のトラッキングで撮影をトリガーし、人数の最終確認は写真AIが行う",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "AFKpQ",
          "name": "e4",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#ECEEE7",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 3,
          "padding": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "8EsPV",
